    "No answer."
   ],
   "sub": "Digging begins.",
   "log": "> logs: not found",
   "text": "Without a record, you start digging. Terminal scrollback is gone, and nobody remembers which command ran.",
   "scene": [
    {
     "k": "term",
     "lines": [
      [
       "> grep logs for tuesday",
       "r"
